# Observed libusb-1.0 installation

What this library was verified against. It is a record of an installed package
rather than a vendored tree: libusb-1.0 comes from the system, and nothing here is a
copy of its source.

pkg-config --modversion libusb-1.0   1.0.29
pkg-config --libs libusb-1.0         -lusb-1.0
header                               /usr/include/libusb-1.0/libusb.h

The include path pkg-config reports is not used. libusb-1.0 headers sit at
their package-qualified path under a default search directory, so a wrapper
including <libusb-1.0/libusb.h> needs no include directory, which is what lets this
library declare an interface of one link input and nothing else.
